  m_Text: 'Full-score improvements added:

    - Main menu, level select, instructions,
    credits, pause, victory, game over, retry, next level, and return flow.

    -
    HUD shows score, high score, hull, objective progress, timer, threat level, and
    active power-ups with visual bars.

    - Gameplay changes: two levels, dynamic
    difficulty, boss enemy, destructible hazards, and four power-ups.

    - Feedback:
    sound effects, hit flashes, danger flash, camera shake, status messages, and
    readable objectives.


    Credits: Starter space art, audio, font, scripts,
    and prefabs from the provided class UnityPackage.'
